{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "sg-support-api",
    "name": "School Guardian — Support Platform",
    "description": "API de tickets da School Guardian.\n\n1. Preencha `email` e `password` (usuário que já existe em `fsfadm_Usuarios`).\n2. Rode **Auth → Login**. O token fica em `accessToken` e passa a ir no header `Authorization` das outras pastas.\n3. Respostas autenticadas renovam o token no header `X-Access-Token`; a collection substitui `accessToken` automaticamente.\n\n`baseUrl` local: `http://127.0.0.1:3000` (banco `DB_*`). Hom: `https://suporte-t.schoolguardian.app`. Prod: `https://suporte.schoolguardian.app`. O token de um endereço não serve no outro.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const renewed = pm.response.headers.get('x-access-token');",
          "if (renewed) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', renewed);"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:3000" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "schoolId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "ticketId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "postId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "Verifica se a API está disponível. Público."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code !== 200) return;",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(body.user.id));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "description": "Público, com rate limit. Devolve Bearer token (10 min) e grava `accessToken` e `userId`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
            "description": "Usuário autenticado."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
            "description": "Encerra a sessão. Nesta base o `tokenVersion` não é gravado em `fsfadm_Usuarios`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "Rotas da API. Criar, alterar ou excluir usuário responde 403: `fsfadm_Usuarios` é do outro sistema e esta API não grava nela.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create user",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Maria Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"maria@escola.com\",\n  \"login\": \"maria.silva\",\n  \"password\": \"senha-super-forte\",\n  \"role\": \"agent\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
            "description": "Admin. Papéis: admin, agent, requester. Senha com no mínimo 12 caracteres."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&pageSize=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20", "description": "Máximo 100" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Admin. Lista paginada."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get user",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}",
            "description": "Admin ou o próprio usuário."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update user",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Maria Silva\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}",
            "description": "Admin ou o próprio. `role` e `active` só admin. Troca da própria senha exige `currentPassword`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete user",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}",
            "description": "Admin. Não apaga linha em `fsfadm_Usuarios`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Schools",
      "description": "Admin e agent. Só id e nome, para o seletor de escola.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List schools",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/schools?page=1&pageSize=20",
            "description": "Retorna `{ data: [{ id, name }], meta }`. O `id` é o `schoolId` do ticket."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tickets",
      "description": "Admin e agent. Códigos de status, devStatus, entryType e slaType vêm de GET /tickets/options.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ticket options",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/options",
            "description": "Códigos e rótulos de status, devStatus, entryType e slaType."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create ticket",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code !== 201) return;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('ticketId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"schoolId\": {{schoolId}},\n  \"entryType\": \"email\",\n  \"status\": \"aguardando\",\n  \"priority\": false,\n  \"supportLevel2\": false,\n  \"devStatus\": null,\n  \"errorType\": null,\n  \"slaType\": \"medio\",\n  \"schoolResponsible\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets",
            "description": "A escola precisa existir em `fsfadm_Escolas` (senão 422). Grava `ticketId`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List tickets",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets?page=1&pageSize=20&schoolId={{schoolId}}&status=aguardando&devStatus=em_analise&entryType=email&slaType=medio&priority=false&supportLevel2=false",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tickets"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20", "description": "Máximo 100" },
                { "key": "schoolId", "value": "{{schoolId}}", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "status", "value": "aguardando", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "devStatus", "value": "em_analise", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "entryType", "value": "email", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "slaType", "value": "medio", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "priority", "value": "false", "disabled": true, "description": "true ou false" },
                { "key": "supportLevel2", "value": "false", "disabled": true, "description": "true ou false" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Filtros opcionais vêm desligados. Status: aguardando, em_analise, aguardando_suporte_n2, resposta_n2_realizada, done."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get ticket",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}",
            "description": "Detalhe do ticket."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update ticket",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"em_analise\",\n  \"priority\": true,\n  \"devStatus\": \"em_analise\",\n  \"slaType\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}",
            "description": "Atualização parcial. `null` limpa campos opcionais (devStatus, errorType, slaType, datas, schoolResponsible)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete ticket",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}",
            "description": "Admin. Exclui o ticket e os posts em cascata."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Posts",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create post",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code !== 201) return;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('postId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"Primeiro contato com a escola.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/posts",
            "description": "Admin ou agent. O autor é o usuário autenticado. Grava `postId`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List posts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/posts?page=1&pageSize=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tickets", "{{ticketId}}", "posts"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20", "description": "Máximo 100" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ordem cronológica (mais antigos primeiro)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update post",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"Texto atualizado do post.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/posts/{{postId}}",
            "description": "Autor ou admin."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete post",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/posts/{{postId}}",
            "description": "Autor ou admin."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
